# Large data assets that ship in the built wheel (package-data in
# pyproject.toml) but don't belong in git history: worddata is ~140MB of
# precomputed per-language function-word/IDF/POS tables, and the Wikipedia
# training corpus (devtools/wikipedia_corpus/) is ~48GB, used only to train
# SynthelionML/PrivacyGuardML checkpoints, never read at runtime.
synthelion/worddata/
devtools/wikipedia_corpus/
